flowchart LR
    VM[Linux VM]
    MI[System-assigned MI]
    Entra[Microsoft Entra ID]
    Token[Access token]
    KV[Key Vault]
    Role[Key Vault Secrets User<br/>role assignment]
    Secret[Secret value]

    VM --> MI
    MI --> Entra
    Entra --> Token
    Token --> KV
    Role -.grants access.-> KV
    KV --> Secret
    Secret --> VM
